First we need a list of all concepts we want to have.
We need a list of their defining properties.
We need their complete definition in English.

After that we can try matching them with existing Lojban words and their te
bridi.
If absent add new words with only those te bridi you need to get a complete
specification but not more than that.
If an existing word has more places than we need a new word should be
considered instead.

